      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "和$\\frac{3}{5}$互补成1. 为了求出一个分数的补数，必须从1中减去",
        "这个分数，例如：",
        "$1-\\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{5}{5}-\\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{3}{5}$，　$1-\\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{5}{5}-\\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{2}{5}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "989",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "989. 把1化成下列分母的分数：2，3，11，20."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "990",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "990. 求差并验算：",
        "1) $1-\\frac{3}{4}$；　2) $1-\\frac{2}{7}$；　3) $1-\\frac{1}{6}$；　4) $1-\\frac{8}{9}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "991",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "991. 求出下列分数的补数：",
        "1) $\\frac{5}{11}$；　2) $\\frac{7}{13}$；　3) $\\frac{7}{40}$；　4) 0.01."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "992",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "992. 求出下列各式的值：",
        "1) $\\left(1-\\frac{5}{8}\\right)\\cdot\\left(1-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)$；　　2) $\\left(1-\\frac{7}{12}\\right):\\left(1-\\frac{3}{8}\\right)$；",
        "3) $1-\\left(\\frac{3}{5}+\\frac{1}{4}\\right)$；　　4) $\\frac{1}{4}-\\left(1-\\frac{5}{12}\\right)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "993",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "993. 求下列各式的值：",
        "1) $-1+\\frac{3}{4}$；　　2) $1-\\frac{4}{11}$；　　3) $-1-\\frac{2}{5}$；",
        "4) $-1+\\frac{9}{10}$；　　5) $\\frac{3}{5}-1$；　　6) $\\frac{8}{17}-1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "994",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "994. 解方程：",
        "1) $1-x=\\frac{3}{10}+\\frac{1}{15}$；　　2) $y-1=\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{6}{7}$；",
        "3) $x+1=\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot\\frac{3}{8}$；　　4) $1+y=\\frac{5}{12}:\\frac{5}{2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
